{"text":"So, needless to say, I would then respond with, well, I have a degree in journalism and I know French. My upbringing, most of my childhood was spent in Addis Ababa Ethiopia. We came right after the Civil War and we went to a little American missionary school called Bingham Academy and so I was exposed to American culture for the first time and I was mesmerized by all these movies that we would see and our teachers were American and they had all this stuff and I was just so enthralled by it and there was one TV channel in Addis and they would show some American TV shows so a different world, I was like, wow, what would it be like to be a student at Hillman College and how fun it would be to have ice cream and sing with your friends like on Kids Incorporated but my favorite thing to do at school was, well, except for, you know, studying because I was a hard student, working student. I liked the library and I was introduced to all these books and my favorite was The Babysitter's Club.","words":[{"text":"So","start":0.0,"end":1.2,"punct":","},{"text":"needless","start":1.54,"end":1.74},{"text":"to","start":1.74,"end":2.08},{"text":"say","start":2.08,"end":2.3,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":2.46,"end":2.56},{"text":"would","start":2.56,"end":2.88},{"text":"then","start":2.88,"end":3.08},{"text":"respond","start":3.08,"end":3.5},{"text":"with","start":3.5,"end":3.82,"punct":","},{"text":"well","start":3.94,"end":4.02,"punct":","},{"text":"I","start":4.14,"end":4.34},{"text":"have","start":4.34,"end":4.76},{"text":"a","start":4.76,"end":4.9},{"text":"degree","start":4.9,"end":5.22},{"text":"in","start":5.22,"end":5.66},{"text":"journalism","start":5.66,"end":6.08},{"text":"and","start":6.08,"end":6.66},{"text":"I","start":6.66,"end":6.9},{"text":"know","start":6.9,"end":7.08},{"text":"French","start":7.08,"end":7.46,"punct":"."},{"text":"My","start":9.64,"end":10.02},{"text":"upbringing","start":10.02,"end":10.36,"punct":","},{"text":"most","start":10.52,"end":1